TI  - Exploring the link between recreational substances and physical activity in children and adolescents: insights from the Health Behavior in School-Aged Children study (2013-2019)
T2  - BMC PUBLIC HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Alcohol
KW  - Cannabis
KW  - Moderate-to-vigorous physical activity
