TI  - Cognitive outcome of early school-aged children born very preterm is not predicted by early short-term amplitude-integrated electroencephalography
T2  - ACTA PAEDIATRICA
LA  - English
KW  - amplitude&#8208
KW  - integrated electroencephalography
KW  - cognitive outcome
KW  - prediction
KW  - preterm infant
