TI  - Reduced functional connectivity of fronto-parietal sustained attention networks in severe childhood abuse
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - SCHOOL-AGED CHILDREN
KW  - SEROTONIN TRANSPORTER POLYMORPHISM
