TI  - Effects of gestational age on brain volume and cognitive functions in generally healthy very preterm born children during school-age: A voxel-based morphometry study
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - LOW-BIRTH-WEIGHT
KW  - CORTICAL DEVELOPMENT
KW  - ADOLESCENTS BORN
KW  - EARLY ADULTHOOD
KW  - INFANTS
