TI  - The COVID generation: the neurodevelopmental consequences of in-utero COVID-19 exposure
T2  - BRAIN BEHAVIOR AND IMMUNITY
LA  - English
KW  - COVID-19
KW  - Neurodevelopment
KW  - qMRI
KW  - Bayley scales
KW  - Neonatal brain
KW  - Cortical gray matter
KW  - Fetal programming
