TI  - Reduced corticomotor excitability and motor skills development in children born preterm
T2  - JOURNAL OF PHYSIOLOGY-LONDON
LA  - English
KW  - TRANSCRANIAL MAGNETIC STIMULATION
KW  - LOW-BIRTH-WEIGHT
