TI  - Patterns and descriptors of COVID-19 testing and lab-confirmed COVID-19 incidence in Manitoba, Canada, March 2020-May 2021: A population-based study
T2  - LANCET REGIONAL HEALTH-AMERICAS
LA  - English
KW  - Coronavirus disease 2019
