TI  - Progress and Challenges in Bacterial Meningitis A Review
T2  - JAMA-JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN MEDICAL ASSOCIATION
LA  - English
KW  - MENINGOCOCCAL DISEASE
KW  - LUMBAR PUNCTURE
KW  - ADULTS
