TI  - Regional brain volume abnormalities and long-term cognitive outcome in preterm infants
T2  - JAMA-JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN MEDICAL ASSOCIATION
LA  - English
KW  - BIRTH-WEIGHT INFANTS
