TI  - Maternal and cord plasma branched-chain amino acids and child risk of attention-deficit hyperactivity disorder: a prospective birth cohort study
T2  - JOURNAL OF CHILD PSYCHOLOGY AND PSYCHIATRY
LA  - English
KW  - Attention-Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder
KW  - cord blood
KW  - metabolome
KW  - branched-chain amino acids
KW  - PATHOPHYSIOLOGY
KW  - ETIOLOGY
