TI  - Incidence and severity of childhood pneumonia in the first year of life in a South African birth cohort: the Drakenstein Child Health Study
T2  - LANCET GLOBAL HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - PNEUMOCOCCAL CONJUGATE VACCINE
KW  - GLOBAL BURDEN
KW  - SYSTEMATIC ANALYSIS
KW  - MORTALITY
